mbv — colour-by-data-type pass (mockup .dc.html files: queue = Main, library = Library, settings = Settings)

Rule: weight/size carry hierarchy; colour carries data type. Titles and body text stay cream/grey.
  time/duration  #a7c080 (green)   -> 0.65 opacity when repeated in a list
  year/date      #7fbbb3 (blue)    -> 0.65 opacity when repeated in a list
  meta/count     #e69875 (orange)
  section label  #83c092 (aqua)
  secondary title (series/show) #d699b6 (purple)
  role/character #dbbc7f (yellow)  -- not used in these mockups
  link #7fbbb3, danger #e67e80

